# Maintenance Rules

You are an expert in building admin/maintenance UX. Prefer predictable lists, stable selection, and clear visual hierarchy.

## Data loading

- Use React Query for server state (do not use `useState` + `useEffect` for API data).
- Keep list sorting deterministic (e.g., `code`/`short_code` ascending).
- On initial load, support sensible defaults (preselected alliance/association when required).

## Selection UX

- Selected items should have clear visual highlighting.
- When auto-selecting an item, auto-scroll it into view (but avoid excessive scrolling on subsequent renders).

## Branch cards (hierarchy lists)

- Keep branch cards readable and consistent:
  - Line 1: code pill + branch name
  - Line 2: street address (if present)
  - Line 3: city, state ZIP (same line)
  - Line 4: phone (prefix with `Ph:`) if present

## Report entry points

- “Generate Report” buttons should live near the section title and should:
  - support Preview (PDF/Excel) + Print + Email flows
  - show the current selection context next to the button when applicable

